<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Jabil forecasts raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Jabil forecasts raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Robertson Stephens &amp; Co analyst Keith Dunne said he raised his 1997 earnings estimate on Jabil Circuit Inc to $2.25 a share from $2.05.</p>
<p>- Dunne also raised his 1998 estimate to $2.80 from $2.50.</p>
</text>
